  "instructions_to_main_agent": "Implement a light glassmorphism design system in React Native Expo. Use 'expo-blur' for frosted glass effects on cards, nav bar, and overlays. Rely on soft shadows and inner white borders (rgba(255,255,255,0.8)) for edge highlights on glass surfaces. DO NOT use generic gray borders. Prioritize Apple's UI feel: ample padding, large typography with tight letter spacing, and floating UI panels on the Map tab. All images must be used from media_urls; avoid any placeholders. Use react-native-reanimated for smooth transitions and interactions. Since these are .js files, define your styles explicitly with StyleSheet."
}